6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21048198</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="aws238-B16"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hulstaert</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Blennow</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ivanoiu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Schoonderwaldt</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name><name><surname>Riemenschneider</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>de Deyn</surname><given-names>PP</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Improved discrimination of Alzheimer's disease patients using the combined measure of beta-amyloid<sub>(1</sub><sub>&#x02013;</sub><sub>42)</sub> and tau in CSF, a multicenter study</article-title><source>Neurology</source><year>1999</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>1555</fpage><lpage>62</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10331678</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="aws238-B17"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Josephs</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahlskog</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Parisi</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Boeve</surname><given-names>BF</given-names></name><name><surname>Crum</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Giannini</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Rapidly progressive neurodegenerative dementias</article-title><source>Arch Neurol</source><year>2009</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>201</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19204156</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="aws238-B18"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kapaki</surname><given-names>EN</given-names></name><name><surname>Paraskevas</surname><given-n